+# Checkout
+
+1. The cart total is computed with `calcTotal` (see `src/cart/total.ts`).
+2. `paymentIntent` turns the total into a payment intent in USD. A cart that
+   totals zero or less is rejected with "Nothing to pay".
+3. The payment provider confirms the intent; the order is created only after
+   confirmation.
+
+Amounts are always integers in cents. Never convert to floating-point dollars
+before the final display step.
